        <NEMO_annot:comment rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">OBO NOTE: &quot;there appears to be some consistency in usage as to whether processes or continuants realize&quot; (probably &quot;inconsistency&quot; was intended here?)</NEMO_annot:comment>
