        <NEMO_annot:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">occurs_within is the processual equivalent of located_in, where where the subject is a processual entity either an extended process or a punctate event), and the predicate specifies a time interval (similar to an extended spatial_region); does not imply that processual entity is present throughout interval.</NEMO_annot:definition>
