        <NEMO_annot:definition_source rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">Hopf, J.-M., Vogel, E.,Woodman, G., Heinze, H.-J., &amp; Luck, S. (2002). Localizing visual discrimination processes in time and space. Journal of Neurophysiology, 88, 2088–2095.</NEMO_annot:definition_source>
