        <NEMO_annot:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">International 10-10 channel O2 (ITT_O2) is a standard location on the scalp surface that is located in the right_occipital_scalp_surface_region. It is caudal_to ITT_PO2 and left_of ITT_PO6.</NEMO_annot:definition>
