        <NEMO_annot:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">International 10-10 channel PO4 (ITT_PO4 is a standard location on the scalp surface that is located in the right_occipital_scalp_surface_region. It is rostral_to ITT_O2, left_of ITT_PO6, and right_of ITT_PO2.</NEMO_annot:definition>
