        <NEMO_annot:pref_label rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">experiment_instruction</NEMO_annot:pref_label>
        <NEMO_annot:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">experiment_instruction is an explicit direction that guides the behavior of the subject during an experimental session. It is formulated as a command.  If a subject is instructed to read words aloud, the instruction is &quot;Read&quot; and the response type is &quot;Speech&quot;; rather than &quot;Speak&quot; as the instruction. (adapted from BrainMapLex)</NEMO_annot:definition>
