        <NEMO_annot:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">The visual modality is the sensory modality that pertains to the sense of sight. It usually but not always arises from the stimulation of the visual system with a light source of sufficient brightness to be visible.</NEMO_annot:definition>
