        <NEMO_annot:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">A behavioral_process is an overt (observable) process that is the result of a motor_process. It involves initiation and control of the skeletal muscle systems (e.g., movement of arms, legs, eyeballs).</NEMO_annot:definition>
        <NEMO_annot:onto_definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">ontoDefinition text goes HERE</NEMO_annot:onto_definition>
