        <NEMO_annot:modified_date rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">2010-07-23</NEMO_annot:modified_date>
        <NEMO_annot:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">A signal processing algorithm is a mathematical separation and/or combination of time-series data using various algorithms to manipulate the distinct frequency or spatiotemporal components of a set of an input data stream to produce an output data stream.</NEMO_annot:definition>
        <NEMO_annot:onto_definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">A signal_processing_algorithm is an algorithm that is realized through implementation of (code)....</NEMO_annot:onto_definition>
