        <NEMO_annot:onto_definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">CON_ROI_mean_intensity is a ... [incomplete]</NEMO_annot:onto_definition>
        <NEMO_annot:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">For some set of scalp EEG measurement values, specifies the mean electrical potential, in microvolts, over all electrodes within the region-of-interest (as specified by the CON) at the time of maximal negative intensity.</NEMO_annot:definition>
        <NEMO_annot:comment rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">Has corresponding term in Bob Frank&apos;s NEMO_ERP_Metric_Extraction matlab script: CON_ROI_Mean_Intensity</NEMO_annot:comment>
