        <NEMO_annot:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">A biomaterial surface is a surface (external or internal) of some biomaterial object, e.g. surface of the heart (heart-external surface, when looking at heart as an organ between two lung lobes, and heart-internal surface when looking at the surface of one of the heart ventricles).</NEMO_annot:definition>
