        <NEMO_annot:onto_definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">A segment_border_probability_algorithm is an algorithm that is realized through implementation of (code)....</NEMO_annot:onto_definition>
        <NEMO_annot:definition_source rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">Murray, M. M., Brunet, D., &amp; Michel, C. M. (2008). Topographic ERP analyses: a step-by-step tutorial review. Brain Topogr, 20(4), 249-264.</NEMO_annot:definition_source>
