        <NEMO_annot:modified_date rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">2010-11-12</NEMO_annot:modified_date>
        <NEMO_annot:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">An excitatory postsynaptic potential (EPSP) is a graded change in the membrane potential of a postsynaptic cell produced by a synaptic input that increases the probability that the cell will fire an action potential.</NEMO_annot:definition>
