        <NEMO_annot:acronym rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">SLI</NEMO_annot:acronym>
        <NEMO_annot:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">Specific language impairment is a developmental language disorder that can affect both expressive and receptive language. It is characterized by markedly delayed language development in the absence of deafness, autism, or mental retardation.</NEMO_annot:definition>
