        <NEMO_annot:definition_source rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">Curator.</NEMO_annot:definition_source>
        <NEMO_annot:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">Weakly_positively_aroused is a quality that momentarily inheres in some brain or brain part and that constitutes a &quot;snapshot&quot; in time of certain types of emotional process (e.g., depression and dysthymia).</NEMO_annot:definition>
