        <NEMO_annot:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">DC_offset_measurement_datum is the offset of a direct current (DC) signal from zero. It is also characterized as the input voltage that is needed to produce a zero output voltage when no signal is input to an amplifier.</NEMO_annot:definition>
        <NEMO_annot:namespace rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">NEMO_data</NEMO_annot:namespace>
