        <NEMO_annot:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">An upper ontology defines ontologically (or sometimes linguistically) &quot;basic&quot; classes and properties that can be used as a foundation for building mid-level and domain-specific ontologies.</NEMO_annot:definition>
