        <NEMO_annot:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">A word_naming_paradigm is an experimental_paradigm in which a pronounceable letter string (word or pseudword) is presented, and the participant is asked to articulate (or pronounce) the letter string.</NEMO_annot:definition>
