        <NEMO_annot:definition_source>Watson, D., L. A. Clark, et al. (1988). &quot;Development and validation of brief measures of positive and negative affect: the PANAS scales.&quot; J Pers Soc Psychol 54(6): 1063-1070.</NEMO_annot:definition_source>
