        <NEMO_annot:comment rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">In the NEMO toolkit, the left_centrotemporal_scalp_surface_region includes the following international 10-10 channels: FT7, FT9, T7, and T9 (left).</NEMO_annot:comment>
        <NEMO_annot:namespace rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">NEMO_spatial</NEMO_annot:namespace>
