        <NEMO_annot:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">left_posterotemporal_scalp_surface_region is the left part of the posterotemporal_scalp_region. It is left of the left_parietal_scalp_region and caudal to the left_frontotemporal_scalp_region.</NEMO_annot:definition>
        <NEMO_annot:comment>See also definition of &quot;central&quot; (NEMO_0000188) and &quot;left temporal&quot; (NEMO_8302000). The &lt;left_centrotemporal_scalp_surface region&gt; has_quality &lt;central&gt; and has_quality &lt;left temporal&gt;.</NEMO_annot:comment>
        <NEMO_annot:synonym>LCTEMP</NEMO_annot:synonym>
        <NEMO_annot:curator rdf:resource="&ontology;NEMO_annotation_properties.owl#Gwen_Frishkoff"/>
