        <NEMO_annot:namespace rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">NEMO_data</NEMO_annot:namespace>
        <NEMO_annot:pref_label rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">electrode_montage_ID</NEMO_annot:pref_label>
        <NEMO_annot:onto_definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">electrode_montage_ID is a ... [incomplete]</NEMO_annot:onto_definition>
        <NEMO_annot:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">textDefinition: Specifies the distribution of electrodes on the scalp surface and the manner in which pairs of electrodes are connected to their corresponding differential amplifier. Electrode distributions may be based on standardized (International 10-10, International 10-20) or proprietary  (EGI HCGSN-128, EGI HCGSN-256) arrangements and employ common reference, average reference, or bipolar amplifier connections.</NEMO_annot:definition>
