        <NEMO_annot:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">A data_measurement_protocol is a protocol that specifies the experiment context in which data are measured and recorded (i.e., stored, typically in a digital format) for later analysis.</NEMO_annot:definition>
        <NEMO_annot:onto_definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">A statistical_test_protocol is a protocol that has_specified_input some data_set</NEMO_annot:onto_definition>
