        <NEMO_annot:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">A scalar measurement datum that is the result of measuring the intensity (syn ~ strength, level, magnitude, or amplitude) of some entity.</NEMO_annot:definition>
        <NEMO_annot:onto_definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">An intensity_measurement_datum is a scalar_measurement_datum that is_about SOME intensity (quality).</NEMO_annot:onto_definition>
