        <NEMO_annot:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">A right_inferior_frontotemporal_scalp_surface_region is a region of the scalp surface that is inferior to some right_frontotemporal_scalp_surface_region.</NEMO_annot:definition>
        <NEMO_annot:onto_definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">A right_inferior_frontotemporal_scalp_surface_region is a scalp_surface_region that is the exact location_of some right_inferior_frontotemporal_scalp_surface.</NEMO_annot:onto_definition>
