        <NEMO_annot:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">emse_file_format refers to a family of data formats created by the EMSE Suite software toolkit developed and distributed by Source Signal Imaging Inc., and that is used for 4D multimodal functional brain imaging, including analysis, source estimation, image processing, and visualization.</NEMO_annot:definition>
