        <NEMO_annot:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">An ITT_frontotemporal_electrode location is a point located in the frontotemporal regions of the scalp surface.</NEMO_annot:definition>
        <NEMO_annot:onto_definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">An ITT_frontotemporal_electrode location is an ITT_electrode location that is disjoint with ITT_parietal_electrode location, ITT_posterotemporal_electrode location, ITT_occipital_electrode location, ITT_frontocentral_electrode location, and ITT_frontopolar_location.</NEMO_annot:onto_definition>
