        <NEMO_annot:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">Specifies for each spatiotemporal component pair the computed relative difference between the mean electrical potential at CON_ROI_Label and the mean electrical potential at its homologous, opposite hemisphere, scalp-surface region. CON_Laterality_Index is labeled as the concatenation of laterality (Left, Right, Bilateral) and the computed relative difference.</NEMO_annot:definition>
        <NEMO_annot:curator rdf:resource="&ontology;NEMO_annotation_properties.owl#Gwen_Frishkoff"/>
