        <NEMO_annot:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">Specifies the center of positivity (COP) as a point on the 2-D flat map at which all positive electrical potential at the scalp-surface electrodes can be equivalently located. Computationally, it is analogous to a center of mass calculation with electrode potentials replaced by point masses.</NEMO_annot:definition>
        <NEMO_annot:comment rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">has_part (COP_xCoord_2D);; has_part (COP_yCoord_2D); is_about (COP_2D); has_coordinate_unit_label (??)</NEMO_annot:comment>
