        <NEMO_annot:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">A cartesian spatial coordinate datum is a representation of a point in a spatial region, in which equal changes in the magnitude of a coordinate value denote length qualities with the same magnitude</NEMO_annot:definition>
