        <NEMO_annot:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">A study group role is a study population role where the bearer is a population of material entities and the role is realized in the implementation of a study design wherein the entities bearing the study population role are observed or subjected to intervention according to the study design and are biological replicates, i.e. they receive the same treatment under the protocol.</NEMO_annot:definition>
        <NEMO_annot:comment rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">Imported into NEMO_functional</NEMO_annot:comment>
        <NEMO_annot:namespace rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">NEMO_imported_classes</NEMO_annot:namespace>
